      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "No SQL runs before user approval.  No SQL runs before validation passes.  Model never receives DB credentials.  Model never executes SQL.  Final CSV contents are not sent back to the model by default.  SQL and traces stay in read-only Advanced views.",
